# Conformance probe pack for spec 0.46 with `via` (0.6): the table sees the
# string `code` yields and the integer `codenum` yields. Public. No kinds.
format  conformance-charset-via
version 0.46.0
distribution public
source  "synthetic format, no external standard"
uses    probe
wire    bits
word_bytes 1
bit_order  msb
charset D  0123456789
map     grade  01  alpha
map     grade  02  beta
map     nums   7   seven
field   probe.s1  0:0:8  code:D,D     via grade
field   probe.s2  0:8:8  codenum:D,D  via nums
